情、文案内容、字体排版、文字大小、符号、颜色、标签、人种、年龄、肤色、版式构成、环境构成等（不少于5处具体细节）\n4.场景氛围：温馨、神秘、奇幻、宁静、末世感等\n5.艺术风格：现实主义、赛博朋克、油画风、水彩、3D渲染、卡通、像素风、未来主义等\n6.构图视角：如“俯视”、“仰视”、“特写”、“广角”、“远景”、“全景”、“近景”、“特写”等\n\nPrompt 输出格式要求\n1.语言：仅使用中文生成 prompt\n2.语气：自然语言、描述性强、画面感明确，避免口语化或模糊措辞\n3.结构：连贯自然，不分条目，形成一段完整描述\n4.长度：足够详尽，建议不少于60词\n内容限制：\n1.不解释 prompt 内容\n2.不添加“生成提示词”、“Prompt:”等前缀\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [480, 260], "pos": [120, 860], "id": 41, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [40], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [520, 820], "pos": [-480, 300], "widgets_values": ["1226a0ef21385d9adeef23984732334bcfa068fe581628fcb1fec96fd9d67963.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "reel", "links": [46], "label": "reel", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel"}], "size": [290, 270], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [5190, -170], "widgets_values": ["zimage-turbo", "krea2_turbo", "boogu", "", 1280, 32], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 48, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_nam